# Backend & Bot Standards

## Technology Stack
- **Runtime**: Node.js (Latest LTS)
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Library**: Discord.js (if applicable)
- **Testing**: Vitest or Jest

## Patterns
- **Command Pattern**: Separate each bot command into its own class or file.
- **Event Handling**: Use a dedicated event handler to decouple discord events from business logic.
- **Dependency Injection**: Use simple DI patterns to make services testable.

## Error Handling
- Never let the bot process crash. Use try-catch blocks in command executors.
- Log errors with context (User ID, Command name, Guild ID).
- Provide user-friendly error messages in Discord interactions.